                                    <div id="content">
                                       <p>
                                          <input class="jpibfi" type="hidden"><p>Copper Events is an all-inclusive event management company, based in Mumbai providing authentic and bespoke luxury wedding planning services.</p>
<p>Copper Events’ personal approach ensures the weddings they plan are meaningful and truly reflect their clients as individuals, as couples, and as a family and echoes their shared values and sense of style.</p>
<p>Recognized for its exquisite style and lifestyle approach to weddings and events, Copper Events is proud to cater to a vast client base including honourable political figures, some of India&#8217;s esteemed business families, and celebrities. From destinations and aesthetics to entertainment and managing every wedding ritual, every aspect of your wedding is seamlessly managed. Starting from guest management and invitees to wedding trousseau, beauty regime, and styling to curating for you the finest artist and menus, their team meticulously works around the clock. </p>
                                       </p>
